sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API
  participant Service
  participant Ledger
  participant DB
  participant Job

  Client->>API: POST /v1/transfers
  API->>Service: Transfers::Create
  Service->>DB: lock source balance projection
  Service->>Ledger: post balanced journal
  Ledger->>DB: create journal + lines
  Ledger->>DB: update projections
  Service->>DB: create outbox event
  Service-->>API: transfer response
  DB-->>Job: enqueue outbox publish
